  "authority_rules": [
    "Czech Post outputs establish current routing assignments and exception classes, never a nationwide official PSČ perimeter.",
    "RÚIAN CSV establishes public address-place identity, PSČ membership and an S-JTSK definition point; a point is not a postcode polygon or building footprint.",
    "A future point-derived surface remains derived_geometry, needs a pinned method and independent holdout, and is never branded as an official Czech Post boundary.",
    "Facility, P.O. box, organization/addressee, transport-hub and contracted-partner classes receive no invented surrounding area.",
    "No-delivery-service classification remains an exception record and does not become a deliverability or geometry claim.",
    "Exact building display requires a separate source-defined RÚIAN building relation; containment, proximity and postcode equality are insufficient."
  ]
